KAMUI MP+amo-rl-aq
"Message passing through AMOs with rl and aq bits: release and acquire read-modify-writes at system scope (K2): forbidden."
{
x=0;
y=0;
}
 P0@cta 0,gpu 0         | P1@cta 1,gpu 0        ;
 sw x, 1                | amoor.w.aq r0, y, 0   ;
 amoswap.w.rl r9, y, 1  | lw r1, x              ;
exists
(P1:r0 == 1 /\ P1:r1 == 0)
